          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "By the end of first grade, the Head Start Impact Study found few statistically significant differences for the sample as a whole.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The report follows children from program entry through first grade and reports this result for the randomized groups as a whole. It does not establish that every subgroup, unmeasured outcome, or later-life outcome was zero.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
